  "description": "The Cat in the Hat once said, “It’s fun to have fun, but you have to know how.”  \n\nPlay with your favorite characters from this exciting Dr. Seuss classic. Enjoy two exciting game modes - ‘Find The Cat’ and catch him before the rest of your opponents do, or test your cake decorating and snowball throwing skills in ‘Minigames’.  With easy controls, varying difficulties, and vibrant visuals, this game has something fun for everyone. Whether you play solo or with friends, your house is about to be full of giggles, groans, and glorious mayhem. \n\nELEVATE YOUR GAME NIGHT: Dive into the mayhem solo or race to the end with up to 4 players.  \n\nCLASSIC DR. SEUSS CHARACTERS: Play as Sally, Johnny, Thing 1 & Thing 2 and Little Cat. \n\nCHOOSE YOUR MODE FOR NON-STOP FUN: Pick from 18 entertaining minigames or find The Cat across 14 rooms. \n\nBOUNCE, CHASE & PAINT TO WIN: Compete for rewards. Will you find all the stickers for your book? \n\nA PARTY FOR ALL AGES: Re-play in different ways, with easy controls and varying difficulties.\n",
